OL,3,GNEWSATwo gas workers guilty over fatal
OL,4,Aexplosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo gas workers have been found guilty
OL,7,Fof gross negligence manslaughter
OL,8,Ffollowing a fatal explosion in a block
OL,9,Fof flats.
OL,11,FTen people died following the explosion
OL,12,Fat Haut du Mont flats in Jersey in the
OL,13,Fearly hours of 10 December 2022.
OL,15,FEmployees Neil Armstrong and John
OL,16,FWright were found guilty of 10 counts
OL,17,Fof gross negligence manslaughter on
OL,18,FWednesday. Jurors also returned a
OL,19,Funanimous guilty verdict for gas
OL,20,Fcompany Island Energy for health and
OL,21,Fsafety breaches.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
